      "content": "Entry Quality still selects conditions using the weighted-average entry rather than each fill, contrary to the per-lot rule. For example, with O-C2's Stops at measurement values 0 and 1, two one-contract fills at 0.50 and 1.50 each risk $50, totaling $100. Their average is 1.00, so this code skips the Stop at 1 and reports $200 risk instead. Select the Stop and Target for each execution in the entry window and aggregate the resulting monetary distances; retain the average for the average-entry display.",
